  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Casa Blanco - This home is proffesionally managed by Beach Habitats 30a and comes with 8 bicyles. Private Pool! Beautiful Courtyard! Newfurniture and new photos coming soon. <br>Property includes dedicated Rosemary Beach® community Beach Access via 9 Private Beach Walkovers. Beach chair service available for an additional cost through RBPOA Beach Service and access to all community pools. <br><br>Bienvenidos to Casa Blanco, an extraordinary eight-bedroom luxury beach house in the heart of Scenic Highway 30A, where coastal grandeur meets unparalleled comfort for up to 20 guests. This sprawling 6,300+ square foot masterpiece, complete with a detached carriage house, promises an unforgettable family vacation, group retreat, or multi-generational getaway. Picture your loved ones arriving at the grand front entrance, welcomed by a charming fountain and vibrant butterfly garden—setting the tone for pure indulgence in one of Florida's most coveted destinations.<br><br>Step into the private courtyard and be captivated by the expansive pool area, designed for endless entertainment. Lounge on the plush outdoor sectional, savor al fresco meals under the covered dining space, or simply soak in the sun-drenched ambiance. This Santa Rosa Beach vacation rental isn't just a home—it's your personal paradise for creating lifelong memories.<br>Inside the main home's lower level, unleash your culinary creativity in the state-of-the-art chef's kitchen, featuring premium appliances, ample counter space, and seamless flow into the open living area with a cozy fireplace. Gather around the oversized dining table seating 10, or perch at the bar for casual chats—perfect for bonding over family dinners or sunset toasts. Retreat to the opulent king master bedroom with elegant lounge seating and a spa-like en-suite bath boasting double vanities, a luxurious soaking tub, and invigorating walk-in shower.<br><br>Ascend to the second level, admiring the home's unique architectural flair and stylish decor in this brand-new construction. A welcoming lounge awaits with a comfy sofa, flatscreen TV, and balcony offering serene views of Kingston Road. Down the hall, the spacious family suite features a king bed, hidden bunk bed, and private bath with double vanities and walk-in shower—ideal for keeping everyone together. Two additional king junior master suites provide privacy with their own upgraded en-suites, while the dedicated bunk room sleeps four kids in two cozy bunks, with a convenient bathroom just steps away.<br>The top level elevates your experience with stunning bird's-eye vistas of the surrounding community, another family suite complete with a king bed, two built-in twins, private bath, and a third lounging area equipped with TV—ensuring every guest finds their perfect spot to unwind.<br><br>Adding even more allure, the detached carriage house offers versatile space for extended family or ultimate privacy. Downstairs, dive into fun in the expansive game room with foosball, a full-size arcade loaded with over 7,500 games, and a full bathroom accessible directly from the pool—ideal for quick rinses after beach days. Upstairs, a fully equipped kitchen simplifies meal prep, paired with a comfortable king bedroom, private en-suite bath, and inviting living area.<br>With driveway parking for four large vehicles, convenience is key in this luxury 30A beach rental. High-speed Wi-Fi, multiple smart TVs, and complimentary beach gear like chairs and umbrellas enhance your stay, making Casa Blanco a top-rated choice for Santa Rosa Beach vacation homes.<br><br>Nestled along Florida's Emerald Coast, Casa Blanco places you moments from iconic 30A hotspots. Wander around enchanting Rosemary Beach, with its European-inspired architecture, boutique shopping, farm-to-table restaurants, and lively town square—perfect for evening strolls, live music, or grabbing artisanal treats. Explore sophisticated Alys Beach, famed for its pristine white buildings, upscale galleries, fine dining, and peaceful butterfly park, evoking Mediterranean elegance just a short drive away. Embrace the relaxed charm of Seacrest, where you can dip into coastal dune lakes, rent bikes for leisurely rides, or feast on fresh Gulf seafood at beachfront eateries. And indulge at 30Avenue, a vibrant hub of designer shops, gourmet ice cream parlors, wine bars, and entertainment venues—ideal for a day of retail therapy or family fun.<br><br>The 30A region is a haven for outdoor enthusiasts, offering transformative adventures that rejuvenate the spirit and strengthen bonds. Cycle the scenic 19-mile Timpoochee Trail through lush state parks and quaint communities on bikes or e-bikes, breathing in the fresh coastal air. Glide across rare coastal dune lakes like Western Lake via paddleboard or kayak, spotting native wildlife in this unique ecosystem. Venture into Point Washington State Forest for invigorating hikes, birdwatching amid towering pines, or serene picnics. Reel in the thrill of Gulf fishing from shores, charters, or piers, or amp up the excitement with stand-up paddle yoga, eco-tours, or romantic horseback rides along the sugar-white sands at dusk. With year-round mild weather and endless sunshine, these experiences aren't just activities—they're the heart of what makes a 30A vacation truly magical.<br><br>Join the chorus of ecstatic guests who've crowned Casa Blanco their favorite luxury vacation rental in Rosemary Beach, praising its expansive layout, premium amenities, and prime location (see our stellar reviews!). In this high-demand paradise, dates book up quickly—imagine your family laughing by the pool, exploring hidden gems, and returning home refreshed. Don't let this opportunity slip away; secure your stay at Casa Blanco today and transform your dreams into reality. What are you waiting for? Book now and embark on the coastal adventure of a lifetime!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Luxurious 8-Bedroom with Private Pool, Enchanting Courtyard and Game Room"
        }
      ],
